id -u
# bootGate2 attempt 1 landed on zroot (fallback worked as designed). Capture the cut receipts, then reboot for a MANUAL ZBM menu pick.
# AT THE ZBM MENU: use the arrow keys, select nvme/ROOT/void, press Enter. If the menu shows ONLY zroot entries, let it auto-boot zroot and paste that fact.
